sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant O as Owner's browser
  participant S as Server
  participant A as Trusted person A
  participant B as Trusted person B
  Note over O,S: Setup (once)
  A->>S: accept invite: public key + private key encrypted with A's passphrase
  O->>O: split vault key into pieces (k of n)
  O->>S: each piece encrypted to that person's public key + key check
  Note over S: Owner stops answering check-ins
  S->>A: email: please approve
  S->>B: email: please approve
  A->>S: approve (button, not a GET)
  B->>S: approve
  Note over S: waiting period, owner can still stop it
  S->>A: email: vault is open (access link)
  A->>S: fetch my encrypted piece + ciphertext items
  A->>A: passphrase unlocks piece, shown as a code
  B->>B: same, then reads the code to A
  A->>A: combine pieces, key check passes, decrypt items
